      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom fifth-floor apartment to the market at No. 178 Burnell Square, a stylish and highly sought-after development ideally positioned just off the Malahide Road. Set within the popular Burnell Square development, this spacious apartment offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, together with excellent resident facilities, lift access, secure basement parking and a fantastic location. The property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, owner occupiers, downsizers and investors alike.\n\nExtending to approximately c. 69 sq.m, the accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, generous master double bedroom complete with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, useful storage room, fully tiled family bathroom and a modern kitchen area. The kitchen and living accommodation are cleverly separated by a stylish partition which allows the space to remain bright and open while creating a natural distinction between the two areas. The bright living room then opens directly onto a superb south-west facing private balcony, providing an excellent outdoor space and an ideal setting to enjoy the afternoon and evening sun. The apartment is further enhanced by double glazing, a fully fitted alarm system, Electric heating and excellent storage throughout.\n\nResidents of Burnell Square benefit from a host of excellent on-site amenities and facilities, including a secure basement car park with designated parking space, bike storage and access to a communal roof terrace. The development is exceptionally well positioned, with bus stops located directly outside the apartment providing regular and convenient services to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The nearby Malahide Road provides easy access to a wealth of shopping, dining and recreational amenities, with Clarehall Shopping Centre, Tesco, Meadows & Byrne and a wide variety of cafés, restaurants and local services all within easy reach. Donaghmede Shopping Centre and Northside Shopping Centre are also located nearby, providing further shopping and everyday conveniences.\n\nFor commuters, the location is second to none, with excellent access to the M50 and M1 motorways, allowing for easy connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond. Dublin Airport is also only a short drive away, making this an ideal choice for those who travel regularly. The nearby DART network further enhances the location, with Clongriffin DART Station providing direct rail services towards Dublin City Centre and beyond. The surrounding area also benefits from a wide selection of schools, parks, sports clubs and recreational amenities, while the coastal amenities of Malahide, Portmarnock and Howth are all within convenient travelling distance.\n\nViewing is highly recommended. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 015411455 or 0861985247 to arrange a viewing or for further information.\n\nFeatures\n• c. 69 sq.m\n• BER B\n• Management fees approximately 2,215\n• Fifth-floor apartment\n• 2 double bedrooms\n• 2 bathrooms\n• Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe\n• Ensuite bathroom\n• South-west facing private balcony\n• Bright and spacious living room\n• Modern fitted kitchen\n• Kitchen and living area separated by stylish partition\n• Storage room\n• Family bathroom\n• Lift access\n• Secure basement car parking space\n• Bike storage in basement\n• Communal roof terrace\n• Fully alarmed\n• Double glazed windows\n• Bus stops directly outside the apartment\n• Excellent public transport links\n• Easy access to Clongriffin DART Station\n• Convenient access to M1 and M50 motorways\n• Dublin Airport within easy reach\n• Clarehall Shopping Centre nearby\n• Tesco and Meadows and Byrne within easy reach\n• Close to a wide selection of shops, cafés and restaurants\n• Excellent choice of schools and recreational amenities nearby\n• Convenient to Malahide, Portmarnock and Howth\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, owner occupiers, downsizers and investors\n• Early viewing highly advised"
      },
